                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPad",
                "text": "As we move forward this legislative session, we have a responsibility to our citizens to try new things so they can keep doing what they do best, which is taking care of each other. \n\nWe can provide property tax relief and reform. Continue to address the mental health challenges our most vulnerable people face. Work on short-term and long-term solutions to our workforce, child care and housing challenges. Support our law enforcement, our firefighters and our first responders, and continue to build on policy that makes North Dakota the most military-friendly state in the country. \n\nNorth Dakota is not broken. It does not need fixing. \n\nWe are home to the best people in the world. The State of the State is as resilient as its people.\u00a0\n\nState of the State Press Release: https://t.co/kxxP2nOmhw",
